# =============================================================================
# NameCraft — root env overview
# =============================================================================
# Each app has its own .env.example with the vars it actually needs. Copy each
# to a real .env inside that app's folder:
#
#   cp server/.env.example          server/.env
#   cp client-customer/.env.example client-customer/.env
#   cp client-admin/.env.example    client-admin/.env
#
# Secrets (Mongo URI, JWT secret, Cloudinary secret, Razorpay secret, SMTP)
# live ONLY in server/.env and are never exposed to any client.
# The clients only get PUBLIC values (API base URL, Razorpay public key,
# Cloudinary cloud name).
# =============================================================================
